{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45380","headline":"周长史昉画毗沙门天王歌 · 皎然","name":"周长史昉画毗沙门天王歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长史画神独感神，高步区中无两人。\n雅而逸，高且真，形生虚无忽可亲。\n降魔大戟缩在手，倚天长劒横诸绅。\n慈威示物虽凛凛，在德无秋唯有春。\n吾知真象本非色，此中妙用君心得。\n苟能下笔合神造，误点一点亦爲道。\n写出霜缣可舒卷，何人应识此情远。\n秋斋清寂无外物，盥手焚香聊自展。\n忆昔胡兵围未解，感得此神天上下。\n至今云旗图我形，爲君一顾烟尘清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}